   "config": {
    "text": "<p style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>Smoke screening:</strong> click a unit, then open <em>Unit selected on map</em> — or search / upload in the other tab. Set the burn date, ignition hour and duration, then run. Layers show the NWS smoke forecast, air districts and Class I areas.</p>",
