   "label": "Outlook notes",
   "config": {
    "text": "<p style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>How to read this page.</strong> Turn on layers in <em>Monthly &amp; Seasonal Outlooks</em> (CPC 6–10/8–14 day, monthly, 3-month seasonal; Predictive Services Month 1–4 fire potential) and <em>Typical Rx Burn Days</em> (gridMET 2016–2025: average days per month meeting a generic broadcast Rx — Tmax 40–80°F, RHmin 20–50%, wind ≤12 mph). Click a grid cell for all 12 months. For your own Rx and unit, use the Weather Evaluator page.</p>",
